{
  "id": "yaml-lens",
  "name": "YAML 调试台",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "YAML 粘进来看穿一切：解析预览（多文档/锚点/合并键）+ 坑检测（Norway problem：unquoted no/on/off 在 PyYAML/Go-yaml/kubectl 里是布尔；前导零 02134 八进制、六十进制 12:34:56、版本号塌陷 1.10→1.1、大整数超 2^53 丢精度、重复键带行列、Tab 缩进、智能引号、时间戳漂移 2024-01-02→Date、注释吞值、键后缺空格、空值 null）+ YAML↔JSON 双向转换（不折行/noRefs）。每条坑给严重度/行列/跨实现行为对照/修复建议。js-yaml 4.1.0 基座、行为全部实测锁定，纯本地零外联零 kv，MCP 四工具（parse/lint/to_json/to_yaml）+ 面板三视图。",
  "enabledByDefault": true,
  "contributes": {
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "yaml-lens.panel",
        "area": "activityBar",
        "panelType": "yaml-lens",
        "icon": "Code2",
        "labelKey": "plugins.yaml-lens",
        "labelDefault": "YAML 调试台",
        "order": 98
      }
    ],
    "panel": {
      "entry": "./dist/panel.js",
      "supportsFullscreen": false
    },
    "mcpServers": [
      {
        "id": "yaml-lens",
        "transport": "stdio",
        "command": "node",
        "argsTemplate": [
          "{{pluginDir}}/mcp/server.js"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "permissions": {
    "aiToolAccess": true
  },
  "origin": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin/tree/main/plugins/yaml-lens",
    "updateUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin@main/plugins/yaml-lens/update.json",
    "downloadUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/misxzaiz/Polaris-plugin@main/plugins/yaml-lens/yaml-lens.zip"
  }
}
